%tr{ id: comment.id }
  %td= comment.owner.comment_owner_label rescue nil
  %td= comment.commentable.commentable_label rescue nil
  %td= comment.content
  %td= comment.rating
  %td= state_label_of_comment(comment)
  %td= reply_detail(comment)
  %td
    状态修改：
    =remote_select_form([:backend, @current_shop, @current_branch, comment], 'comment[state]', Ddt::Comment::state_collection_hash, comment.state)
    = reply_btn(comment, remote: true) if comment.comment.blank?
